'' No tiko.toml: the directory named is the project and its package root (--package-root), so the
'' generated main in its out/test/ reaches lib/calc; a file merely named like a test, which does
'' not import std/testing, is left alone and noted under -v (TKO1204).
'' TEST: cli
'' HOSTS: windows
'' ENV: TIKO_MODCACHE=build/.ttn/cache
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
